msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architecture"

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/architecture.md:3
#: 443813cd0bb14d0591e3f8705b47e303
msgid ""
"Defensive scenarios are converted into reviewable risk signals without "
"exposing offensive automation as a product surface."
msgstr ""
"Les scenarios defensifs sont convertis en signaux de risque revisables sans "
"exposer l'automatisation offensive comme surface produit."

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/architecture.md:5
#: 4a8daaf0a1b24295a29396e494535249
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "Flux de donnees"

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/architecture.md:11
#: 227548be80614d47a09a749f1e6b1fba
msgid "Provenance"
msgstr "Provenance"

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/architecture.md:13
#: b6ac12d3374d4086acf13bccb53173a7
msgid ""
"Record the repository commit, configuration, input identifiers, execution "
"command, output location, and validation result. A screenshot alone is not a"
" reproducible artifact."
msgstr ""
"Consignez le commit du depot, la configuration, les identifiants d'entree, "
"la commande d'execution, l'emplacement de sortie et le resultat de "
"validation. Une capture seule n'est pas un artefact reproductible."

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/architecture.md:15
#: bfc287f0d69f45f288b5803e16a9f0b5
msgid "Failure behavior"
msgstr "Comportement en cas d'echec"

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/architecture.md:17
#: d44a875ea43d4a6bac5e923d89b0b734
msgid ""
"Missing configuration, unavailable dependencies, invalid input, and failed "
"tests must remain visible. The tool must not replace a failure with invented"
" success."
msgstr ""
"Une configuration absente, des dependances indisponibles, une entree "
"invalide et des tests echoues doivent rester visibles. L'outil ne doit pas "
"remplacer un echec par un succes invente."
